1
00:00:00,405 --> 00:00:03,035
Ow! It's eating my face!

2
00:00:03,609 --> 00:00:04,739
(Raj:)It's eating his face!

3
00:00:11,984 --> 00:00:14,244
(Sheldon(throwing alien onto the laptop):)I found your webcam
and replaced the video feed.

4
00:00:14,419 --> 00:00:16,579
(Sheldon(throwing alien onto the laptop):)You two should be ashamed of yourselves.

5
00:00:16,755 --> 00:00:19,585
- Sheldon, we're really sorry.
- Yeah, really sorry.

6
00:00:19,758 --> 00:00:20,778
(Sheldon:)Sorry?

7
00:00:20,993 --> 00:00:25,763
(Sheldon:)You may not realize it, but I have difficulty
navigating certain aspects of daily life.

8
00:00:25,931 --> 00:00:30,061
(Sheldon:)You know, understanding sarcasm.
Feigning interest in others.

9
00:00:31,570 --> 00:00:33,900
(Sheldon:)Not talking about trains
as much as I want to.

10
00:00:34,640 --> 00:00:35,700
(Sheldon:)It's exhausting.

11
00:00:35,874 --> 00:00:39,934
Which is why, for 20 minutes a day,
I like to go down to that room...

12
00:00:40,112 --> 00:00:43,642
(Sheldon:)...turn my mind off,
and do what I need to do to recharge.

13
00:00:44,516 --> 00:00:46,746
(Howard:)But what are you doing in there?

14
00:00:46,919 --> 00:00:48,389
And what does 43 mean?

15
00:00:48,554 --> 00:00:51,254
(Sheldon:)You don't need to know,
you don't deserve to know...

16
00:00:51,423 --> 00:00:53,793
(Sheldon:)...and you will never know.

17
00:00:54,826 --> 00:01:41,026
(Raj:)Yeah, well, I know how to make
your egg salad now.

